alse,"",""],"widgets_values_named":{"filename_prefix":"preview","filename_suffix":"","format":"png","bit_depth":"8-bit","input_color_space":"sRGB","overwrite_original":false,"保存":"","image_fallback":""}},{"id":22,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[40,320],"size":[560,1140],"flags":{},"order":4,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"使用说明","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"MarkdownNote","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["## 万物变化 (图片换样式 · 单遍直出)\n\n以「原建模」为底，**保持原构图不变**，只改样式/服装/材质等外观，一遍编辑直接出图。\n\n### 流程\n- 图1/2/3 多图参考 + 「变化提示词」→ 编辑采样 → 结果预览\n- **前后对比**: 图1(改前) vs 结果(改后), 拖拽对比条查看\n\n### 参考图 (image1/2/3)\n- **图1** = 底图(VAEEncode 基准 + 身份锚点), **图2/图3** = 额外参考; 空图输出 None 不报错\n- 提示词用 **图1/图2/图3**(Picture 1/2/3)指代, 顺序不能错\n\n### 4步/20步 切换(开关)\n| 模式 | 步数 | 4步LoRA | denoise |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 标准(关) | 20 | 关 | 0.95 |\n| 加速(开·默认) | 4 | 开 | 0.9 |\n\n- **cfg 固定 1.0**; 负面与正面同为 EditPlus(带图): 同 图1/2/3 + 表格「变化-负面」, 正负形状一致, 提示词框无预填充、完全 md 驱动\n- 精细改 → 切**标准 20 步**\n\n### denoise 说明\n- denoise 0.95/0.9 = 真改衣服; 之前 0.5/0.7 太低导致衣服不变\n- **面部保持**: 靠图1 参考锚定 + 提示词写明「保持面部/五官/发型完全不变」\n- 提示词写法: 保持原构图 → 描述新样式/装束 → 整体风格统一 → 保面部\n\n### 操作\n1. 「选择md文件」→ 选 `stories/七纹刻印/0012_万物变化.md`\n2. 「打开数据」→ 选中一行 → 确定\n3. 点 Run → 结果预览 + 前后对比"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## 万物变化 (图片换样式 · 单遍直出)\n\n以「原建模」为底，**保持原构图不变**，只改样式/服装/材质等外观，一遍编辑直接出图。\n\n### 流程\n- 图1/2/3 多图参考 + 「变化提示词」→ 编辑采样 → 结果预览\n- **前后对比**: 图1(改前) vs 结果(改后), 拖拽对比条查看\n\n### 参考图 (image1/2/3)\n- **图1** = 底图(VAEEncode 基准 + 身份锚点), **图2/图3** = 额外参考; 空图输出 None 不报错\n- 提示词用 **图1/图2/图3**(Picture 1/2/3)指代, 顺序不能错\n\n### 4步/20步 切换(开关)\n| 模式 | 步数 | 4步LoRA | denoise |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 标准(关) | 20 | 关 | 0.95 |\n| 加速(开·默认) | 4 | 开 | 0.9 |\n\n- **cfg 固定 1.0**; 负面与正面同为 EditPlus(带图): 同 图1/2/3 + 表格「变化-负面」, 正负形状一致, 提示词框无预填充、完全 md 驱动\n- 精细改 → 切**标准 20 步**\n\n### denoise 说明\n- denoise 0.95/0.9 = 真改衣服; 之前 0.5/0.7 太低导致衣服不变\n- **面部保持**: 靠图1 参考锚定 + 提示词写明「保持面部/五官/发型完全不变」\n- 提示词写法: 保持原构图 → 描述新样式/装束 → 整体风格统一 → 保面部\n\n### 操作\n1. 「选择md文件」→ 选 `stories/七纹刻印/0012_万物变化.md`\n2. 「打开数据」→ 选中一行 → 确定\n3. 点 Run → 结果预览 + 前后对比"},"color":"#222","bgcolor":"#000"},{"id":23,"type":"FallingTSSwitch","pos":[3370,200],"size":[300,340],"flags":{},"order":22,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"为假时 1","name":"false_1","shape":7,"type":"*","link":38},{"localized_name":"为真时 1","name":"true_1","shape":7,"type":"*","link":39},{"localized_name":"为假时 2","name":"false_2","shape":7,"type":"*","link":40},{"localized_name":"为真时 2","name":"true_2","shape":7,"type":"*","link":41},{"localized_name":"开关(布尔)","name":"switch","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"switch"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"总数","name":"total","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"total"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"为假时 3","name":"false_3","shape":7,"type":"*","link":42},{"localized_name":"为真时 3","name":"true_3","shape":7,"type":"*","link":43},{"localized_name":"为假时 4","name":"false_4","shape":7,"type":"*","link":108},{"localized_name":"为真时 4","name":"true_4","shape":7,"type":"*","link":109}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"输出 1","name":"output_1","type":"*","slot_index":0,"links":[44]},{"localized_name":"输出 2","name":"output_2","type":"*","slot_index":1,"links":[45]},{"localized_name":"输出 3","name":"output_3","type":"*","slot_index":2,"links":[46]},{"localized_name":"输出 4","name":"output_4","type":"*","slot_index":3,"links":[110]}],"title":"4步/20步 切换","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"FallingTSSwitch","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":[true,4],"widgets_values_named":{"switch":true,"total":4}},{"id":24,"type":"PrimitiveInt","pos":[3040,520],"size":[250,150],"flags":{},"order":5,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"数值","name":"value","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"value"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"整数","name":"INT","type":"INT","slot_index":0,"links":[40]}],"title":"步数 20 (标准)","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"PrimitiveInt","ue_properties":{"